000001 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000002     PROGRAM-ID. AREARETANGULO.
000003     AUTHOR. Felipe Sinico.
000006
000005 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION. 
000008
000007 DATA DIVISION.
000008 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000009
000010 01 BASE PIC 9999v99.
000011 01 ALTURA   PIC 9999v99.
000012 01 AREA-RETANGULO PIC ZZ9.99.
000013
000014
000015 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000016 PRINCIPAL.
000017     DISPLAY "Entre com BASE DO RETANGULO (em CM): ".
